  "body": "Positioned on one of Milford Beach's most coveted stretches of absolute beachfront, 29 Cecil Road presents a rare opportunity to secure one of Auckland's premier coastal homes. Occupying a superb due north position with no western neighbour, this exceptional residence combines outstanding scale, privacy and direct sandy beachfront in a package seldom available.\r\n\r\nConstructed from solid concrete block and spanning more than 500sqm, the home has been built to endure. Recently renovated to an exceptional standard and meticulously maintained throughout, it offers timeless construction with contemporary luxury, allowing the next owners to simply move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nA dramatic double-height foyer and sweeping staircase create an impressive arrival before opening to generous living spaces designed for effortless family living and entertaining. The beautifully renovated kitchen, completed approximately three years ago, features a substantial island, premium appliances, a large butler's pantry and exceptional workspace, flowing seamlessly to the dining and living areas. Full-height doors connect to an elevated beachfront terrace, capturing magnificent views while maintaining excellent privacy.\r\n\r\nA separate western lounge enjoys the afternoon sun before opening to an expansive entertaining patio with a solar-heated lap pool. The absence of a western neighbour allows natural light to flood the home from morning until evening.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises five generous double bedrooms, each with its own beautifully appointed ensuite. A large ground-floor ensuite bedroom, currently utilised as a home office, provides outstanding flexibility for multi-generational living or guests. Upstairs, the luxurious master suite features an expansive bedroom, lavish ensuite with a separate WC, walk-in wardrobe and private balcony overlooking the Hauraki Gulf.\r\n\r\nThe outlook takes in Milford Marina, Castor Bay, the Whangaparaoa Peninsula, Rangitoto Island and, on clear days, Great Barrier Island.\r\n\r\nIF YOU CAN'T REACH ANDREW DORREEN, PLEASE CONTACT HIS SALES ASSOCIATE ANNA JONES ON 021 489 171",
